# Overflow test fixtures: whitespace inside the test boxes is what the overflow tests measure.
# src/BloomBrowserUI/.prettierignore lists them too, but the pre-commit hook's pretty-quick
# formatted them anyway.
src/BloomBrowserUI/bookEdit/OverflowChecker/*Fixture.html

# The files under the fetched test-input collections are Bloom-generated fixtures
# (book HTML, meta.json, appearance.json, origami.css, etc.). Bloom writes them in its own
# format (e.g. meta.json is minified), so prettifying them here would make every test run
# leave a dirty working tree, and prettier outright fails on the book .htm files. Leave the
# whole tree alone so the fetched fixtures match what Bloom writes.
output/testing-inputs/

# The overflow checker's layout fixtures: the whitespace between their inline elements is
# part of what OverflowChecker.browser.spec.ts measures, and prettier's reflow changes it
# enough to turn its answers around.
src/BloomBrowserUI/bookEdit/OverflowChecker/*Fixture.html
